# text = Maggie thought it very likely that the round house had snakes on the floor , and bats in the bedroom ; for she had seen Bob take off his cap to show Tom a little snake that was inside it , and another time he had a handful of young bats : altogether , he was an irregular character , perhaps even slightly diabolical , judging from his intimacy with snakes and bats ; and to crown all , when Tom had Bob for a companion , he didn't mind about Maggie , and would never let her go with him .
