# text = Bob abstained from remark and passed on , choosing , however , to walk in the shallow edge of the overflowing river by way of change said Bob , as he kicked the water up before him , with an agreeable sense of being insolent to it said Tom , whose mind was prone to see an opposition between statements that were really accordant said Bob said Tom , his imagination becoming quite active under the stimulus of that dread he added , in the tone of a benevolent patron said Bob , to whom hunger did not appear so appalling said Tom , not contemplating the possibility that this recreation might have fewer charms for his mature age said Bob , proudly , coming out of the water and tossing his halfpenny in the air said Tom , instantly fired with the desire to win said Bob , hastily , snatching up the halfpenny as it fell said Tom , loudly and peremptorily said Bob , holding it tight in his pocket said Tom said Bob said Tom , collaring Bob and shaking him said Bob , giving Tom a kick .
