# text = But this morning he was in a mood more becoming a man of business , and in the course of his ride along the Basset lanes , with their deep ruts ,-- lying so far away from a market-town that the labor of drawing produce and manure was enough to take away the best part of the profits on such poor land as that parish was made of ,-- he got up a due amount of irritation against Moss as a man without capital , who , if murrain and blight were abroad , was sure to have his share of them , and who , the more you tried to help him out of the mud , would sink the further in .
