# text = As for Maggie , becoming fascinated , as usual , by a print of Ulysses and Nausicaa , which uncle Pullet had bought as a she presently let fall her cake , and in an unlucky movement crushed it beneath her foot ,-- a source of so much agitation to aunt Pullet and conscious disgrace to Maggie , that she began to despair of hearing the musical snuff-box to-day , till , after some reflection , it occurred to her that Lucy was in high favor enough to venture on asking for a tune .
