# text = Great was Mr . Tulliver's wonder , for he had made a round from Basset , and had not yet been home he said , checking his horse , while Maggie slipped from the donkey and ran to her father's stirrup said the gypsy said Maggie said Mr . Tulliver , taking out five shillings he said , as they rode along , while she laid her head against her father and sobbed sobbed Maggie said Mr . Tulliver , soothingly Mr . Tulliver spoke his mind very strongly when he reached home that evening ; and the effect was seen in the remarkable fact that Maggie never heard one reproach from her mother , or one taunt from Tom , about this foolish business of her running away to the gypsies .
