# text = Mr . Jacobs himself , familiarly known as Old Goggles , from his habit of wearing spectacles , imposed no painful awe ; and if it was the property of snuffy old hypocrites like him to write like copperplate and surround their signatures with arabesques , to spell without forethought , and to spout " my name is Norval " without bungling , Tom , for his part , was glad he was not in danger of those mean accomplishments .
