# text = When Mr . Stelling said , as the roast-beef was being uncovered Tom , to whom in his coolest moments a pun would have been a hard nut , was thrown into a state of embarrassed alarm that made everything dim to him except the feeling that he would rather not have anything to do with Latin ; of course he answered whereupon there followed much laughter and some practical joking with the plates , from which Tom gathered that he had in some mysterious way refused beef , and , in fact , made himself appear
