# text = He was a very firm , not to say obstinate , disposition , but there was no brute-like rebellion and recklessness in his nature ; the human sensibilities predominated , and if it had occurred to him that he could enable himself to show some quickness at his lessons , and so acquire Mr . Stelling's approbation , by standing on one leg for an inconvenient length of time , or rapping his head moderately against the wall , or any voluntary action of that sort , he would certainly have tried it .
