# text = But it was worth purchasing , even at the heavy price of the Latin Grammar , the happiness of seeing the bright light in the parlor at home , as the gig passed noiselessly over the snow-covered bridge ; the happiness of passing from the cold air to the warmth and the kisses and the smiles of that familiar hearth , where the pattern of the rug and the grate and the fire-irons were " first ideas " that it was no more possible to criticise than the solidity and extension of matter .
