# text = And there is no better reason for preferring this elderberry bush than that it stirs an early memory ; that it is no novelty in my life , speaking to me merely through my present sensibilities to form and color , but the long companion of my existence , that wove itself into my joys when joys were vivid Fine old Christmas , with the snowy hair and ruddy face , had done his duty that year in the noblest fashion , and had set off his rich gifts of warmth and color with all the heightening contrast of frost and snow .
