# text = Law was a sort of cock-fight , in which it was the business of injured honesty to get a game bird with the best pluck and the strongest spurs he observed presently , in a pugnacious tone , as if poor Gritty had been urging that lawyer's capabilities Tom , looking round with some anxiety at this announcement of his prospects , unthinkingly withdrew a small rattle he was amusing baby Moss with , whereupon she , being a baby that knew her own mind with remarkable clearness , instantaneously expressed her sentiments in a piercing yell , and was not to be appeased even by the restoration of the rattle , feeling apparently that the original wrong of having it taken from her remained in all its force .
