# text = Sitting on the coach on their way home , the brother and sister talked to each other in sad , interrupted whispers said Maggie said Tom , leaping from the vaguest impressions to a definite conclusion said Maggie , in a tone of sad remonstrance ; but she had no spirit to dispute anything then , still less to vex Tom by opposing him When the coach set down Tom and Maggie , it was five hours since she had started from home , and she was thinking with some trembling that her father had perhaps missed her , and asked for " the little wench " in vain .
