# text = As for Maggie , she was peculiarly depressed this morning ; she had been called up , after brief rest , at three o'clock , and had that strange dreamy weariness which comes from watching in a sick-room through the chill hours of early twilight and breaking day ,-- in which the outside day-light life seems to have no importance , and to be a mere margin to the hours in the darkened chamber .
