# text = But instead of saying anything more to him , his father continued to look with a growing distinctness of suspicion at Mr . Glegg and the deeds he said sharply he added impatiently , as Mr . Glegg advanced to the foot of the bed before speaking said Mr . Glegg , in a soothing tone Mr . Tulliver looked around him meditatively , at Tom , at Mr . Glegg , and at Maggie ; then suddenly appearing aware that some one was seated by his side at the head of the bed he turned sharply round and saw his sister he said , in the half-sad , affectionate tone in which he had been wont to speak to her said good Mrs .
