# text = But now his feet were on the sharp stones ; the belt of shingles had widened , and the stretch of sand had dwindled into narrowness said Maggie , putting her arm through Tom's as he was warming himself rather drearily by the kitchen fire Tom's mouth twitched with a bitter expression as he looked at the fire said Maggie , who couldn't help mingling some gayety with their sadness said Tom said Maggie , putting her cheek against his coat-sleeve said Tom , with the little frown he put on when he was about to be justifiably severe Poor Tom ! he had just come from being lectured and made to feel his inferiority ; the reaction of his strong , self-asserting nature must take place somehow ; and here was a case in which he could justly show himself dominant .
