# text = Maggie , in her brown frock , with her eyes reddened and her heavy hair pushed back , looking from the bed where her father lay to the dull walls of this sad chamber which was the centre of her world , was a creature full of eager , passionate longings for all that was beautiful and glad ; thirsty for all knowledge ; with an ear straining after dreamy music that died away and would not come near to her ; with a blind , unconscious yearning for something that would link together the wonderful impressions of this mysterious life , and give her soul a sense of home in it .
