# text = Already , at three o'clock , Kezia , the good-hearted , bad-tempered housemaid , who regarded all people that came to the sale as her personal enemies , the dirt on whose feet was of a peculiarly vile quality , had begun to scrub and swill with an energy much assisted by a continual low muttering against and made light of " scrazing " the tops of mahogany tables over which better folks than themselves had had to -- suffer a waste of tissue through evaporation .
