# text = Our instructed vagrancy , which was hardly time to linger by the hedgerows , but runs away early to the tropics , and is at home with palms and banyans ,-- which is nourished on books of travel and stretches the theatre of its imagination to the Zambesi ,-- can hardly get a dim notion of what an old-fashioned man like Tulliver felt for this spot , where all his memories centred , and where life seemed like a familiar smooth-handled tool that the fingers clutch with loving ease .
