# text = Strange contrast , you may have thought , between the effect produced on us by these dismal remnants of commonplace houses , which in their best days were but the sign of a sordid life , belonging in all its details to our own vulgar era , and the effect produced by those ruins on the castled Rhine , which have crumbled and mellowed into such harmony with the green and rocky steeps that they seem to have a natural fitness , like the mountain-pine ; nay , even in the day when they were built they must have had this fitness , as if they had been raised by an earth-born race , who had inherited from their mighty parent a sublime instinct of form .
