# text = I share with you this sense of oppressive narrowness ; but it is necessary that we should feel it , if we care to understand how it acted on the lives of Tom and Maggie ,-- how it has acted on young natures in many generations , that in the onward tendency of human things have risen above the mental level of the generation before them , to which they have been nevertheless tied by the strongest fibres of their hearts .
