# text = The suffering , whether of martyr or victim , which belongs to every historical advance of mankind , is represented in this way in every town , and by hundreds of obscure hearths ; and we need not shrink from this comparison of small things with great ; for does not science tell us that its highest striving is after the ascertainment of a unity which shall bind the smallest things with the greatest ?
