# text = It is something cruelly incomprehensible to youthful natures , this sombre sameness in middle-aged and elderly people , whose life has resulted in disappointment and discontent , to whose faces a smile becomes so strange that the sad lines all about the lips and brow seem to take no notice of it , and it hurries away again for want of a welcome thinks young elasticity
