# text = Ogg's , instead of getting it in a more quiet and indirect way ; and could see nothing but what was entirely wrong and unkind , nay , persecuting , in Tom's reproof of her for this unnecessary act said Tom Surely there was some tenderness and bravery mingled with the worldliness and self-assertion of that little speech ; but Maggie held it as dross , overlooking the grains of gold , and took Tom's rebuke as one of her outward crosses .
