# text = In this June time , too , the dog-roses were in their glory , and that was an additional reason why Maggie should direct her walk to the Red Deeps , rather than to any other spot , on the first day she was free to wander at her will ,-- a pleasure she loved so well , that sometimes , in her ardors of renunciation , she thought she ought to deny herself the frequent indulgence in it .
