# text = After that last word of Philip's , Maggie could not bear to insist immediately on their parting she said at last , timidly said Philip , impatiently here Philip hesitated a little , and then said said Maggie But her heart began to beat with something of Philip's discontent said he , turning quickly round and fixing his gray eyes entreatingly on her face Then , checked by a fear which her face suggested , he looked away again and said more calmly said Maggie , falteringly . ( Could she really do him good ?
