# text = They were come back to the hollow , round which the dog-roses grew , and they both paused under the charm of the faery evening light , reflected from the pale pink clusters said Maggie , quietly Philip had already taken from his pocket a small volume , and was looking at the back as he said Maggie had looked at the back too , and saw the title ; it revived an old impression with overmastering force she said , taking the book from Philip's hands Maggie spoke rapidly , with glistening eyes said Philip , watching her with delight Maggie had not heard a word he had said ; she was absorbed in a page at which she had opened .
