# text = Bob's talk appeared less seemly , now some one besides himself was listening to it said Mr . Glegg , at last returned Bob , nodding his head aside Uncle Glegg , who regarded himself as a jocose man since he had retired from business , was beginning to find Bob amusing , but he had still a disapproving observation to make , which kept his face serious he said But he spoke more in sorrow than in anger , and quickly added said Tom , coloring said Mr . Glegg , in an approving tone added the cautious old gentleman , looking over his spectacles at Bob said Tom said Mr . Glegg , looking at Bob said Bob , rather indignantly said Mr . Glegg said Bob , whose keenness saw at once what was implied said a severe voice from the open parlor window said Mr . Glegg said Mr . Glegg , soothingly said Mr . Glegg said the lady to Bob , in a loud voice , adapted to the moral , not the physical , distance between them said Mr . Glegg he added , stepping in at the French window said Mrs . G ., in a fatal tone said Bob , touching his cap .
