# text = Surely it was only because the sense of a deliverance from concealment was welcome at any cost Three weeks later , when Dorlcote Mill was at its prettiest moment in all the year ,-- the great chestnuts in blossom , and the grass all deep and daisied ,-- Tom Tulliver came home to it earlier than usual in the evening , and as he passed over the bridge , he looked with the old deep-rooted affection at the respectable red brick house , which always seemed cheerful and inviting outside , let the rooms be as bare and the hearts as sad as they might inside .
