# text = The sound of the opening door roused her , and hastily wiping away her tears , she began to turn over the leaves of her book said Lucy , beginning to speak as soon as she entered the room said Maggie said Lucy , taking up her embroidery said Maggie , smiling Lucy had looked up from her work as she uttered the last sentence , and saw that there was a change in Maggie's face said Maggie , rising and going to the window as if she wanted to see more of the landscape said Lucy said Maggie , trying to arrest the prattling stream Lucy went on , not noticing Maggie's faint effort to speak
