# text = She was in her brighter aerial world again , when a little tap came at the door ; of course it was her cousin , who entered in ample white dressing-gown said Lucy , in astonishment retorted Maggie , hastily reaching her own pink cotton gown , and looking at Lucy's light-brown hair brushed back in curly disorder While Maggie stood and unplaited her long black hair over her pink drapery , Lucy sat down near the toilette-table , watching her with affectionate eyes , and head a little aside , like a pretty spaniel .
