# text = If it appears to you at all incredible that young ladies should be led on to talk confidentially in a situation of this kind , I will beg you to remember that human life furnishes many exceptional cases said Maggie , laughing , as she seated herself and tossed her long hair back Maggie pinched Lucy's dimpled chin said Lucy , looking happy already said Maggie , turning pale said Lucy , surprised said Maggie , falteringly said Maggie
