# text = She rose and laid her hand on Tom's shoulder Tom smiled at the eager face ; his smiles were very pleasant to see when they did come , for the gray eyes could be tender underneath the frown said Tom , looking at his watch Tom bent to kiss her cheek , and then said said Tom , pulling his bell violently , and bringing down the small bell-rope said Maggie , making a laughing retreat ; while Tom , with masculine philosophy , flung the bell-rope to the farther end of the room ; not very far either ,-- a touch of human experience which I flatter myself will come home to the bosoms of not a few substantial or distinguished men who were once at an early stage of their rise in the world , and were cherishing very large hopes in very small lodgings said Mr .
