# text = The scene was just what Lucy expected , and her kind heart delighted in bringing Philip and Maggie together again ; though , even with all _her_ regard for Philip , she could not resist the impression that her cousin Tom had some excuse for feeling shocked at the physical incongruity between the two ,-- a prosaic person like cousin Tom , who didn't like poetry and fairy tales .
