# text = But she began to speak as soon as possible , to set them at ease she said , in her pretty treble , like the low conversational notes of little birds she went on , placing the chair that would suit him best said Philip , as he seated himself Lucy gave some playful contradiction , but Philip did not hear what it was , for he had naturally turned toward Maggie , and she was looking at him with that open , affectionate scrutiny which we give to a friend from whom we have been long separated .
