# text = Deane , under those circumstances , considered that he tasted some of the most agreeable moments his merits had purchased him in life , notwithstanding that Lucy , disliking to have her hair powdered with snuff , usually began by mastering his snuff-box on such occasions she said , as she brought up her stool and opened the large fingers that clutched the snuff-box said Mr . Deane , glancing at the reward of merit in the decanter he added , pinching the dimpled chin fondly said Mr . Deane , waving his hands , as if to repel intrusion into that mystery said Mr .
