# text = He chose to lay aside his hat and wear a scarlet fez of her embroidering ; but by superficial observers this was necessarily liable to be interpreted less as a compliment to Lucy than as a mark of coxcombry young Torry observed And Stephen purchased absolutely nothing from Maggie , until Lucy said , in rather a vexed undertone said Stephen Lucy's eyes turned with anxious interest toward Maggie to see how she went through this first interview , since a sadly memorable time , with a man toward whom she must have so strange a mixture of feelings ; but she was pleased to notice that Wakem had tact enough to enter at once into talk about the bazaar wares , and appear interested in purchasing , smiling now and then kindly at Maggie , and not calling on her to speak much , as if he observed that she was rather pale and tremulous said Stephen , in an undertone to Lucy said Lucy , becoming a little indiscreet in her satisfaction , and speaking with an air of significance .
