# text = Most of us , at some moment in our young lives , would have welcomed a priest of that natural order in any sort of canonicals or uncanonicals , but had to scramble upward into all the difficulties of nineteen entirely without such aid , as Maggie did said Dr . Kenn said Maggie , simply , not being accustomed to simpler amiable denials of obvious facts he added Dr . Kenn smiled said Maggie , earnestly , looking at Dr . Kenn with an expression of reliance , as if she had told him her history in those three words .
