# text = Let a prejudice be bequeathed , carried in the air , adopted by hearsay , caught in through the eye ,-- however it may come , these minds will give it a habitation ; it is something to assert strongly and bravely , something to fill up the void of spontaneous ideas , something to impose on others with the authority of conscious right ; it is at once a staff and a baton .
