# text = But now nothing was distinct to her ; she was being lulled to sleep with that soft stream still flowing over her , with those delicious visions melting and fading like the wondrous aerial land of the west When Maggie was gone to sleep , Stephen , weary too with his unaccustomed amount of rowing , and with the intense inward life of the last twelve hours , but too restless to sleep , walked and lounged about the deck with his cigar far on into midnight , not seeing the dark water , hardly conscious there were stars , living only in the near and distant future .
