# text = Even on the supposition that required the utmost stretch of belief ,-- namely , that none of the things said about Miss Tulliver were true ,-- still , since they _had_ been said about her , they had cast an odor round her which must cause her to be shrunk from by every woman who had to take care of her own reputation -- and of Society .
