# text = Along with the sense of danger and possible rescue for those long-remembered beings at the old home , there was an undefined sense of reconcilement with her brother ; what quarrel , what harshness , what unbelief in each other can subsist in the presence of a great calamity , when all the artificial vesture of our life is gone , and we are all one with each other in primitive mortal needs ?
